{"data":{"title":"Reason","slug":"reason","path":"/artists/hablot-brown/tracks/reason/","artwork":"images/artists/hablot-brown/tracks/reason.jpg","artist":{"id":"rvGq626rPAE","slug":"hablot-brown","links":null,"title":"Hablot Brown","artwork":null},"id":"YvK6V0JBwEE"},"appearanceCount":1,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"YgcYQ-3GPyE","show":{"id":"B4wUXA68Ogo","slug":"369","title":"Soulection Radio Show #369 w/Yukibeb","artwork":"/images/episodes/369.jpg","content":"Joe Kay meets up with Japanese DJ [Yukibeb](https://twitter.com/yukibeb) drops a 60-minutes guest mix live in Tokyo.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n\n---\n\nToday we're introducing the Black Label Series, which is focused on highlighting rising vocalists/rappers we're going to be working with.\n\nAs smooth as they are soulful, LA-based group Hablot Brown gives us 5 original tracks that will grab you by the heartstrings. From the vocals to guitar-infused production, the first ever Black Label release will make it hard for you to not follow their journey.\n\nDiscover:<br>\n[soundcloud.com/hablotbrown](https://soundcloud.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[twitter.com/hablotbrown](https://twitter.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[instagram.com/hablotbrown/](https://instagram.com/hablotbrown/)\n\n### Credits\n\nReleased July 29th, 2018\nMixed & Mastered by Joshua Pleeter & Austin Brown\nArtwork: Andre Power\n","published_at":"2018-07-28T11:57:25+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":53608,"platform":"youtube","href":"https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=ez5kQfcqoz4","artwork":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ez5kQfcqoz4/hqdefault.jpg","last_checked_at":"2018-08-02T21:34:41.167+00:00","track":"YvK6V0JBwEE"},{"id":53611,"platform":"audioMack","href":"https://audiomack.com/song/soulection/reason","artwork":"https://assets.audiomack.com/soulection/soulection-black-label-01-hablot-brown-275-275-1532751417.jpg","last_checked_at":"2018-08-02T21:34:38.296+00:00","track":"YvK6V0JBwEE"},{"id":53603,"platform":"spotify","href":"https://open.spotify.com/track/7hdM3l7whE3lTHP